===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[sweet]] [[woodruff]]|-}}

# An aromatic [[perennial]] [[plant]], used as a [[strewing herb]], ''[[Galium odoratum]]'' (formerly ''[[Asperula odorata]]''), with small white flowers.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|herb}} [[sweetscented bedstraw]], [[waldmeister]], [[woodruff]], [[wuderove]]

